        "answer": "Yes, that's correct.",
        "question": "Can I use this card's [All Turns] effect to play a purple Tamer card from my trash?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "It means that you reduce the maximum for the play cost of the card that can be played by this effect by 1 for each card in your opponent's hand.  For example, if your opponent has 4 cards in their hand, you would reduce 10 by 4, resulting in a maximum play cost of 6, meaning that you can play 1 purple card with a play cost of 6 or less without paying the cost.",
        "question": "What does \"for each card in your opponent's hand, reduce this effect's play cost maximum by 1\" in this card's [All Turns] effect mean, exactly?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
